    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Cultivate Your Farm - Plant, water, and harvest a range of fruits and vegetables. Expand your farm as you go to unlock new crops and maximize your yields.<br><br>\ud83c\udf72 Cook for Your Customers - Take fresh ingredients from the field to the kitchen! Use your harvest to prepare unique dishes that satisfy your customers' appetites. Perfect your recipes to keep them coming back for more.<br><br>\ud83d\udcbc Manage Your Day - Balance your time between farming and cooking to meet the needs of your bustling restaurant. Strategize your routine to make the most of each day.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0d Explore a Beautiful Low-Poly World - Immerse yourself in a relaxing and colorful world designed in charming low-poly style, with plenty of details to discover.</p>",
